entries.content:
The Mind-Controlled Townspeople, also known as the Crown Mesa Townspeople, are the chipped people who inhabit Crown Mesa. The Mind-Controlled Citizens each have different appearances and look like ordinary citizens. However, their eyes are all colored red. If examined closely, you can see that the Citizens all have a Mind-Control Chip at the back of their heads which allows PAMA to control their actions and upload their memories onto PAMA's memory banks.

Examples of Speech as the Mind-Controlled Citizens:
{"You will be made useful!", "You will not command PAMA. That is silly.", "You will come to PAMA."}
